What does this code log?

```js
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 0);
}
```

Put these steps in the order they happen when this script runs:

```js
console.log(x);
var x = 5;
console.log(x);
```

What does the third call to `next()` return? Type a number.

```js
function counter() {
  let n = 0;
  return () => ++n;
}
const next = counter();
next();
next();
```

In an ES module (strict mode), what happens when this runs?

```js
const user = { name: 'Ada', greet() { return this.name; } };
const greet = user.greet;
greet();
```
